I had one of thoses. A gnome with a wand of death on the 3rd level of Sokoban.
It happens.

I find that the early game needs some structure in order to build for midgame.
The MPR gives that structure in a low risk environment with a defined benefit
at the end of the road.

>The traditional protection racket doesn't allow that, it keeps random
>wands, rolling boulders, etc as kill possibilities instead of making
